WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.515 --> 00:00:07.801
I always knew I wanted to be a teacher

00:00:08.286 --> 00:00:10.093
I think it was my own love of learning

00:00:10.412 --> 00:00:12.742
that made me passionate about teaching

00:00:13.563 --> 00:00:15.500
Here is a fun fact about me

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.096
many years ago I was a student of the British Council

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:20.818
and now I am a teacher

00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:25.509
Things I love about teaching at the British Council

00:00:26.062 --> 00:00:28.398
is that everybody here is super qualified

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:30.534
and know what they are talking about

00:00:31.103 --> 00:00:33.832
it is a fantastic opportunity to assure

00:00:34.453 --> 00:00:36.116
 qualities and talents with other people

00:00:36.316 --> 00:00:37.916
and also learn many different things

00:00:38.655 --> 00:00:40.019
Most of all I love it because

00:00:40.219 --> 00:00:42.056
I love to see our students improve and develop

00:00:42.256 --> 00:00:44.350
and hear from them or from their parents

00:00:44.745 --> 00:00:47.426
how learning with us has made a real difference to their lives 

00:00:49.781 --> 00:00:52.355
What I love about teaching English at the British Council   

00:00:52.824 --> 00:00:55.500
is the positive and supportive atmosphere

00:00:56.312 --> 00:00:58.720
and of course the number of opportunities it provides

00:00:59.277 --> 00:01:01.145
Best thing for me as a teacher

00:01:01.345 --> 00:01:03.874
is they have really good materials

00:01:04.616 --> 00:01:06.621
and also they have very supportive

00:01:06.821 --> 00:01:09.531
and positive staff which helps a lot

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:15.764
Being a teacher is a huge responsibility

00:01:15.964 --> 00:01:19.213
we shape students future and teach them lifeskills

00:01:19.849 --> 00:01:21.231
I teach and write.

00:01:21.431 --> 00:01:24.548
Try to inspire my students with the love of language

00:01:25.537 --> 00:01:28.896
with the wonder of life, the universe and everything

00:01:29.568 --> 00:01:32.906
I wanna say thanks to all the students I've come across over the years

00:01:33.106 --> 00:01:35.572
for making my job interesting, rewarding  

00:01:36.442 --> 00:01:38.089
and something for which I can live

00:01:40.751 --> 00:01:43.049
if you want to discover a world of possibilities

00:01:43.759 --> 00:01:44.603
Learn with us

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:47.505
There is no better place to learn English

00:01:47.705 --> 00:01:49.340
than the British Council

